1
00:00:00,598 --> 00:00:04,018
(Leonard:)That's not what we're doing tonight.
We're throwing a ball at some pins.

2
00:00:04,227 --> 00:00:05,437
(Penny:)-Yeah, that's right.
-Mm-hm.

3
00:00:05,645 --> 00:00:08,685
(Leonard:)And someday, we don't know when,
maybe you'll love me back.

4
00:00:11,609 --> 00:00:13,399
(Leonard:)Ooh. I'm up.

5
00:00:15,321 --> 00:00:18,661
ALL [CHANTING]:
Sheldon. Sheldon. Sheldon.

6
00:00:18,825 --> 00:00:19,955
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

7
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:24,080
(Sheldon:)I don't know who you're chanting for,
as I am currently the ball.

8
00:00:26,332 --> 00:00:32,342
ALL [CHANTING]:
The ball. The ball. The ball.

9
00:00:35,216 --> 00:00:36,256
(Sheldon:)Thank you, Jesus!

10
00:00:39,137 --> 00:00:40,387
(Sheldon:)As my mother would say.

11
00:00:46,019 --> 00:00:48,649
(Wil:)I'm glad you patched things up
with your boyfriend.

12
00:00:48,813 --> 00:00:50,693
(Penny:)Yeah, me too.

13
00:00:50,857 --> 00:00:53,897
It's tough when the L bomb
gets dropped and you're not ready.

14
00:00:54,069 --> 00:00:55,399
(Penny:)Tell me about it.

15
00:00:56,988 --> 00:01:00,078
(Wil:)I dated this one girl,
and I told her that I loved her...

